# Keep the original MovieLens files outside version control.
.codex-artifacts/
dataset/**
!dataset/.gitkeep
dataset_cleaned/**
!dataset_cleaned/README.md
!dataset_cleaned/cleaning_report.json
!dataset_cleaned/validation_report.json
.dataset_cleaned-*.staging/
**/.venv/
**/__pycache__/
**/*.py[cod]
**/.pytest_cache/
**/.ruff_cache/
**/*.egg-info/
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
**/*.sqlite3
**/*.sqlite3-*
**/*.log
**/.coverage
**/htmlcov/
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
Desktop.ini
project/artifacts/**
!project/artifacts/.gitkeep
**/node_modules/
**/dist/
**/*.tsbuildinfo
project/frontend/.sites-runtime/
project/frontend/test-results/
project/.ui-test-data/
